/**
 * One full, realistic Canvas reply for each kind of request the extension makes.
 *
 * Every reply holds every field that Canvas sends, as serialized by canvas-lms at commit 1c9f0bb:
 * lib/api/v1/{planner_item,planner_override,planner_note,assignment,submission,course,course_json,
 * enrollment_term,group,user,user_profile,locked}.rb and
 * app/graphql/types/{course_type,custom_grade_status_type}.rb.
 * The values belong to the frozen `SCENARIO` at `SCENARIO_NOW`, so each item has a trimmed
 * counterpart with the same id in `scenario.ts`.
 * `tests/unit/full-replies.test.ts` runs each reply through the production decoders and checks
 * that the extra fields change nothing.
 *
 * A list holds some items of the scenario, not all of them.
 * Ids are strings, because every request sends `Accept: application/json+canvas-string-ids`.
 * Ids of lists keyed by course are the course ids.
 */
